0..81 Comment "// The folds over a polymorphic list — its length, appending and mapping — in"
82..158 Comment "// each spelling an arm admits: a `return` after a `run`, the same with both"
159..232 Comment "// elided, and the recursive call nested in the constructor it returns. A"
233..310 Comment "// structural recursive call stands one stage below the list it was read from"
311..385 Comment "// (Abel, _Termination checking with types_, doi:10.1051/ita:2004015); the"
386..462 Comment "// list is the polymorphic one of Martin-Löf\'s type theory. They run at the"
463..506 Comment "// naturals in `recursive-nat-lists.gandr`."
508..538 Comment "// The naturals and the lists."
